          "Title": "Orion",
          "Author": null,
          "Changes": "",
          "Description": "A rocket launch facility in the hills at golden hour after rain: the wet cargo yard between Launch Control and Fuel Processing, the service tunnel under the launch deck, and the rocket on its pad between its service towers.",
